Bare-dot ordered markers

```
. first
. second
. third
.
<ol>
  <li>first</li>
  <li>second</li>
  <li>third</li>
</ol>
```

```
1. explicit
. continues the same list

) not a marker, and never opens one
.
<ol>
  <li>explicit</li>
  <li>continues the same list</li>
</ol>
<p>) not a marker, and never opens one</p>
```

```
.{#x} attributed
. plain
.
<ol>
  <li id="x">attributed</li>
  <li>plain</li>
</ol>
```
